mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Change[UI should update] --> Q1{Is it a primitive field used in the template?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Assign[Assign a new value]
  Q1 -->|Object or array| Q2{Plain {} or [] internals?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Track[Use @track or assign a copy]
  Q2 -->|Date Map Set class| Clone[Clone and assign a new object]
  Change --> Q3{Need computed text?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Getter[JavaScript getter — not a template expression]
  Change --> Q4{Show hide or list?}
  Q4 -->|Conditional| Ifs[lwc:if family not if:true]
  Q4 -->|List| Keys[for:each with unique key not index]
